    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "Katie wants to be a web designer, and really loves otters. She made this website with the help of AI. First she created a `vision.txt` file, and then AI Tutor made a website based on her request. Soon we'll try the same process.\r\n\r\n**Do This:** look at her website and **notice** patterns in the code that help create her site. Try using AI Tutor for help by highlighting text and clicking \"Add to AI Tutor Chat\" to ask how different snippets of code work. This is one way to collaborate with your AI assistant - asking it to explain new things!\r\n\r\n![](https://images.code.org/ec812ef088420ec3556220200feb53d9-image-1773896469655.png)\r\n\r\n**Challenge:** This website has a _bug_ in the last part of the website. Use AI Tutor to help you find the bug and see if you can fix it!",
